  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 602.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 602.01 Applicability. The rules in this part shall apply to:\n\n(a) Any proposed CWS or NTNC other than a CWS or NTNC proposed by a political subdivision;\n\n(b) Any existing water system that is not owned by a political subdivision and does not meet the definition of a CWS or NTNC but plans to be modified so as to become a CWS or NTNC.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 600) #11143, eff 7-26-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw600.html"
